commands:
  mark <text>   write a ==== <text> ==== line into the log
  raw on|off    also print every byte with its timing
  gap <ms>      pause after which leftover bytes are printed as raw
  stats         counters and bit timing
  zero          reset the counters
  lines         show the current tip/ring levels
  trace [n]     print the last n line changes (default 400)
  auto on|off   print the line history around anomalies (default on)
  help
